# No Contributors

Do **not** add any Contributors section, credits block, acknowledgements list, or similar attribution to Cursor, agents, or tools.

- Never create or update `CONTRIBUTORS`, `AUTHORS`, `CREDITS`, or all-contributors files/sections.
- Never add README badges or tables that list Cursor or AI agents as contributors.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, or any other AI/agent co-author trailer to commit messages.
- Never mention Cursor, Auto, Composer, or other agents as authors, contributors, or credits in docs, UI, or metadata.

If existing contributor/credit content for Cursor or agents is present, remove it when touching that file. Human project owners may keep their own attribution; do not invent new contributor entries.
